// Reviewer correction: `Explosion` always detonates centered on the
// caster's own position (common/src/states/explosion.rs, no target-point
// field) -- contradicts the sheet's "erupts from a chosen point" 46m cast
// range. Deviates to `GroundAoe`, the real "detonate at a chosen point"
// primitive, same fix already applied to evocation/acid_splash.ron and
// evocation/snowball_swarm.ron for the identical mismatch.
//
// Damage retuned: original value undertuned relative to
// hemomancy/hemoclysm.ron's own damage/level curve (150 dmg at L7) --
// interpolating that curve against gory_eruption.ron (50 dmg at L3) put
// L6's expected damage around 110-125, not the original 68. Sheet's
// "fail to steel their bodies are seared" save-for-half rider dropped,
// same reasoning blight.ron documents (no partial-damage-on-save
// primitive exists).
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 155.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.9,
    delay: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.55,
    max_range: 46.0,
    radius: 6.0,
    min_falloff: 0.3,
    damage: 118,
    poise: 20,
    knockback: (strength: 10.0, direction: Away),
    dodgeable: Roll,
    reagent: Some(Purple),
    rooted_cast: false,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Necromancy),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        cooldown: Some(45.0),
        // level 6 spell -> min_level 36, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(36)),
    ),
)
